@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Save coursework, then export only saved evidence
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Member
participant "Coursework / CourseworkExport\n<<React functions>>" as Web
participant "coursework_api\n<<functions>>" as API
participant "coursework_store\n<<module>>" as Store
participant "coursework_export / coursework\n<<modules>>" as Export
participant "Local files / compiler" as Local

activate Member
Member -> Web : Save project
activate Web
Web -> API : PUT /api/coursework/project\nProjectProfile snapshot
activate API
API -> Store : save_project(profile)
activate Store
Store -> Local : Validate grammar; acquire project lock;\nwrite, flush/fsync, atomically replace JSON
activate Local
Local --> Store : Saved or validation/storage failure
deactivate Local
Store --> API : ProjectProfile or exception
deactivate Store
API --> Web : Saved ProjectProfile / safe HTTP error
deactivate API
note over Web : Mark submitted snapshot saved, not later edits.\nRefresh saved evidence while preserving editor draft.
Web --> Member : Save notice or retained draft + error
deactivate Web

Member -> Web : Download coursework draft
activate Web
alt Editor dirty / save or screenshot work pending
  note over Web : Export is disabled; save or finish current work.
else Eligible explicit export
  Web -> API : GET /api/coursework/export
  activate API
  API -> Export : export_bundle()
  activate Export
  Export -> Store : load_project(); list_screenshots(); screenshot_path()
  activate Store
  Store --> Export : Saved profile and image references / error
  deactivate Store
  Export -> Local : Read current CSV and images;\nanalyze_coursework(saved grammar, entries)
  activate Local
  Local --> Export : Saved evidence + computed results / error
  deactivate Local
  Export -> Export : build_report(); build_presentation();\nassemble ZIP artifacts and selected sources
  activate Export
  Export --> Export : ZIP bytes
  deactivate Export
  Export --> API : ZIP bytes or exception
  deactivate Export
  API --> Web : application/zip; no-store / safe error
  deactivate API
  note over Web : Validate type/nonempty Blob, start download,\nrevoke object URL; label as DRAFT.
end
Web --> Member : Download started / actionable state
deactivate Web
deactivate Member
legend bottom
  No unsaved practice input or AI answer is included.
  ZIP includes actual corpus/provenance/profile: review before sharing.
  Individual files are protected, but export is not a global multi-file transaction.
  Missing research remains visible; 25 sections do not guarantee 25-30 final pages.
endlegend
@enduml
